very day. So don't worry, off you go.\"","zh":"“由衣，这棵树我每天都会帮你照看。所以你放心去吧。”"},"say":"「ユイちゃん、この木はわたしが毎日見てあげる。だから、安心して行きなさい」","n":[{"from":10,"to":10,"body":{"en":"〜てあげる \"to do something for someone\": 見てあげる \"I'll look after it for you\". You'll meet it properly in the next episode.","zh":"〜てあげる表示“为别人做…”：見てあげる“我替你照看”。下一集会正式学到。"}},{"from":15,"to":15,"body":{"en":"〜なさい is a soft command, used by parents, teachers and older people to children.","zh":"〜なさい是语气温和的命令，父母、老师或长辈对孩子说。"}}],"who":"nakamura","b":[{"from":1,"to":2,"r":"call","g":{"en":"Yui","zh":"小唯"}},{"from":4,"to":6,"r":"topic","h":"topic:は","g":{"en":"as for this tree","zh":"这棵树"}},{"from":7,"to":8,"r":"subj","h":"subj:が","g":{"en":"I","zh":"我"}},{"from":9,"to":9,"r":"time","h":"time","g":{"en":"every day","zh":"每天"}},{"from":10,"to":10,"r":"pred","h":"pred","g":{"en":"will look after (for you)","zh":"替你照看"},"n":{"en":"〜てあげる \"do ~ for someone\".","zh":"〜てあげる“为别人做…”。"}},{"from":12,"to":12,"r":"conn","g":{"en":"so","zh":"所以"}},{"from":14,"to":14,"r":"verb","g":{"en":"don't worry, and","zh":"放心地"}},{"from":15,"to":15,"r":"pred","h":"pred","g":{"en":"go","zh":"去吧"},"n":{"en":"〜なさい is a kind but firm instruction, often from parents or teachers.","zh":"〜なさい是温和而坚定的命令，常用于父母或老师。"}}]},{"id":"kaki/1/14","t":[{"f":"ユイ","r":"ユイ","l":"ユイ"},{"f":"は","r":"は","l":"は"},{"f":"少[すこ]し","r":"すこし","l":"少し"},{"f":"泣[な]いて","r":"ないて","l":"泣く","i":{"en":"te-form","zh":"て形"}},{"f":"から","r":"から","l":"から"},{"f":"、","p":1},{"f":"やっと","r":"やっと","l":"やっと"},{"f":"車[くるま]","r":"くるま","l":"車"},{"f":"に","r":"に","l":"に"},{"f":"乗[の]った","r":"のった","l":"乗る","i":{"en":"past","zh":"过去式"}},{"f":"。","p":1}],"tr":{"en":"Yui cried a little, and then at last she got into the car.","zh":"由衣哭了一会儿，终于上了车。"},"say":"ユイは少し泣いてから、やっと車に乗った。","g":[{"id":"te-kara","from":3,"to":4}],"b":[{"from":0,"to":1,"r":"topic","h":"topic:は","g":{"en":"as for Yui","zh":"唯"}},{"from":2,"to":2,"r":"adv","g":{"en":"a little","zh":"稍微"}},{"from":3,"to":4,"r":"time","h":"time:から","g":{"en":